---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Meet the MBS Medical team. Veteran-owned telehealth with decades of combined clinical experience serving patients across Florida."
>

  <!-- ============================================================
       HERO — peach surface
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-peach" style="padding-top: 7rem; min-height: 70vh; display: flex; align-items: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-split">
        <div>
          <span class="hero-eyebrow">about mbs medical</span>
          <h1 class="hero-title">mind, body, and spirit</h1>
          <p class="hero-sub">
            MBS Medical is a veteran-owned telehealth practice founded on a simple belief: healthcare works better when your provider actually knows you. We treat the whole person, not just the symptoms.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">get in touch</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-media">
          <img src="/images/about-hero.png" alt="MBS Medical team" class="about-hero-img" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       PHILOSOPHY — cream surface
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span class="label">our approach</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">healthcare built on trust, not transactions</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="philosophy-grid">
        <div class="reveal card">
          <div style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--accent-coral);">&#9675;</div>
          <h3>veteran values</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--ink-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-top: 0.75rem;">Founded by a U.S. Army veteran with 12 years of service. Discipline, accountability, and showing up for people aren't talking points. They're how we operate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 card">
          <div style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--accent-sage);">&#8644;</div>
          <h3>continuity of care</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--ink-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-top: 0.75rem;">You see the same provider every time. They know your history, your medications, and your goals. Not just what's in the chart.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 card">
          <div style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--accent-sky);">&#8599;</div>
          <h3>evolving care plans</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--ink-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-top: 0.75rem;">Your care plan isn't static. It grows and adapts as your health changes, your goals shift, and new information comes in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       FOUNDER — sand surface, zigzag
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-sand">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="feature-row reveal">
        <div class="feature-row__media">
          <img src="/images/david.png" alt="David Hervig, PA-C" style="border-radius: var(--radius-xl); width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-fit: cover;" />
        </div>
        <div class="feature-row__text">
          <span class="accent-chip chip-terracotta">founder</span>
          <h2>David Hervig, PA-C</h2>
          <p class="team-role-label">Owner &amp; Founder</p>
          <p>David is a Physician Assistant and U.S. Army veteran who spent 12 years in service, beginning as a combat medic and earning his PA degree from the University of Oklahoma Health Sciences Center.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--ink-secondary);">Emergency medicine trained with experience from pediatrics to geriatrics, David also completed medical education overseas. He was a national champion in springboard diving and brings deep sports medicine knowledge to the practice.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--ink-secondary);">After years watching great care reach only patients who could get to a waiting room, David chose telehealth as his answer: bringing attentive, whole-person medicine to patients across Florida who deserve consistent access to a provider who actually knows them.</p>
          <div class="team-tags">
            <span class="tag">PA-C, Licensed FL</span>
            <span class="tag">12 Years U.S. Army</span>
            <span class="tag">Emergency Medicine</span>
            <span class="tag">Sports Medicine</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       TEAM — shell surface
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-shell">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span class="label">the team</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">who's behind your care</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="team-grid">

        <!-- Julie -->
        <div class="reveal team-member-card">
          <div class="team-member-photo">
            <img src="/images/Julie.jpg" alt="Julie Vera Rivas, MSN, APRN, FNP-C" />
          </div>
          <div class="team-member-info">
            <span class="accent-chip chip-sage" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">nurse practitioner</span>
            <h3>Julie Vera Rivas</h3>
            <p class="team-role-label">MSN, APRN, FNP-C</p>
            <p>Board-certified Family Nurse Practitioner with 27+ years of healthcare experience, including 10 years as a Registered Nurse. She specializes in primary care and weight management with a comprehensive, patient-centered approach.</p>
            <div class="team-tags">
              <span class="tag">MSN, APRN, FNP-C</span>
              <span class="tag">27+ Years Healthcare</span>
              <span class="tag">Weight Management</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dr. Folkens -->
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 team-member-card">
          <div class="team-member-photo">
            <img src="/images/folkens.jpg" alt="Dr. Eric Folkens, MD" />
          </div>
          <div class="team-member-info">
            <span class="accent-chip chip-coral" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">physician &amp; consultant</span>
            <h3>Dr. Eric Folkens, MD</h3>
            <p class="team-role-label">ABFM Certified Diplomate</p>
            <p>Family medicine physician with 34+ years of experience, founder of multiple Florida urgent care centers, and Medical Director of the Bradenton Research Center. Over 150 clinical research studies since 1992.</p>
            <div class="team-tags">
              <span class="tag">ABFM Certified</span>
              <span class="tag">34+ Years</span>
              <span class="tag">Clinical Research</span>
            </div>
            <a href="https://bradentonresearch.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="research-link">
              Bradenton Research Center &rarr;
              <span>bradentonresearch.com</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dr. Dawson -->
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 team-member-card">
          <div class="team-member-photo">
            <img src="/images/dawson.png" alt="Dr. Mark Dawson, MD" />
          </div>
          <div class="team-member-info">
            <span class="accent-chip chip-sky" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">physician &amp; consultant</span>
            <h3>Dr. Mark Dawson, MD</h3>
            <p class="team-role-label">Gastroenterologist</p>
            <p>Gastroenterologist trained at the University of Illinois with a Cook County Hospital GI fellowship. Specializes in colon cancer prevention, biliary and pancreatic diseases. Manatee We Care volunteer for 25+ years.</p>
            <div class="team-tags">
              <span class="tag">Gastroenterology</span>
              <span class="tag">30+ Years</span>
              <span class="tag">Manatee We Care</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Alex -->
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3 team-member-card">
          <div class="team-member-photo">
            <img src="/images/alex.jpg" alt="Alex Anderson" />
          </div>
          <div class="team-member-info">
            <span class="accent-chip chip-butter" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">operations &amp; digital</span>
            <h3>Alex Anderson</h3>
            <p class="team-role-label">Director of Growth &amp; Digital Strategy</p>
            <p>Leads the clinic's digital infrastructure, patient acquisition, and technology systems. Alex's connection to MBS Medical is personal. He first met David as his own patient and never left. Focused on making world-class care accessible to more people.</p>
            <div class="team-tags">
              <span class="tag">Digital Strategy</span>
              <span class="tag">AI Development</span>
              <span class="tag">Telehealth Systems</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       CTA — ink surface
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section bg-ink" style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="reveal" style="max-width: 600px; margin-inline: auto;">
        <h2 style="color: var(--ink-inverse);">ready to meet your provider?</h2>
        <p style="color: rgba(250,246,240,0.7); margin-top: 1rem; font-size: var(--text-lg);">Same-week telehealth across Florida. Book online in minutes.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2rem;">
          <a href="https://mbsmedical.practicebetter.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-inverse">book a visit</a>
          <a href="/services/" class="btn btn-outline-inverse">explore services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>


<style>
  .about-hero-img {
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about-hero-img { aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
  }

  .philosophy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .philosophy-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }

  .team-role-label {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .team-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .tag {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background-color: var(--surface-sand);
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .team-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .team-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }

  .team-member-card {
    background-color: var(--surface-cream);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .team-member-card { flex-direction: row; }
  }

  .team-member-photo {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .team-member-photo { width: 200px; aspect-ratio: auto; min-height: 240px; }
  }
  .team-member-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top;
  }

  .team-member-info {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .team-member-info h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .team-member-info p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .research-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    background-color: rgba(232,116,97,0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232,116,97,0.2);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--accent-coral);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    transition: background-color 150ms ease;
  }
  .research-link span {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .research-link:hover { background-color: rgba(232,116,97,0.14); }

  .feature-row__text p {
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
</style>
